<title>POLAND: SOCCER-POLAND AND ITALY DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-POLAND AND ITALY DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>CHORZOW, Poland 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland and Italy drew</p>
<p>0-0 in their World Cup European group two qualifier on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 32,000</p>
<p>    Standings	Pl   W   D   L   F   A  Pts</p>
<p> Italy		  5   4   1   0   8   1  13</p>
<p> England		4   3   0   1   7   2   9</p>
<p> Poland		 3   1   1   1   3   3   4</p>
<p> Georgia		2   0   0   2   0   3   0</p>
<p> Moldova		4   0   0   4   2   11  0</p>
<p>Next matches: April 30 England v Georgia, Italy v Poland</p>
</text>
